Some excellent ideas in here - although some are potentially
unbalancing.  The ability to dig lots of wells and get lots of wishes
makes wells too useful.  They should probably have a much lower
probability of being a wishing well (c. 1%).

Like the idea of being able to cook food - fire generally is something
that is lacking in nethack.  I know NHINRL, but you would have thought
that a self-respecting tourist would make a fire and cook his food
instead of complaining about how terrible it tastes.

